60,3,1,talk,Shizue,,Option A is free. Option B is fixed by function. Option C is rotating blocks.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Toshio,,"Option B seems fair if we assign by need, not arrival.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,"Option B minimizes the 6,200 yen re-run costs.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Mio,,Option A is risky for my morning gaps.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,Option C is bad for my back if I rotate to loud spots.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Toshio, Option B lets us assign the quiet desks to those who need them.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Shizue, yes. We can name the seats.","{""words"":7,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Mio, Option B gives you a known setup time.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Mio,,"@Daisuke, that helps. I can plan my morning.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Toshio, can I get the window side in Option B?","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Shizue,,I vote for B. It feels stable and fair.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Toshio,,I vote for B. It makes the trade-offs visible.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Daisuke,,I vote for B. It is the most cost-effective.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Mio,,I vote for B. It protects my time.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Shunichi,,"I vote for B. If I get the quiet desk, it is best.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Shizue,,It seems we are all leaning toward B.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Toshio,,Let us confirm.,"{""words"":3,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
